          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngomnyaka wesithathu wokubusa kukaAsa inkosi yakoJuda uBahasha indodana kaAhija waba yinkosi yakoIsrayeli wonke eTiriza; wabusa iminyaka engamatshumi amabili lane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.33",
